{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36355","headline":"李侍御上虞别业 · 方干","name":"李侍御上虞别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满目亭台嘉木繁，燕蝉吟语不爲喧。\n昼潮势急吞诸岛，暑雨声回露半村。\n真爲援毫方掩卷，常因按曲便开尊。\n若将明月爲俦侣，应把清风遗子孙。\n绣羽惊弓离果上，红鳞见饵出蒲根。\n寻君未要先敲竹，且棹渔舟入大门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}